{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0715_rocketm_01",
      "hash": "67d1602d93933ee5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哈哈哈～！\\n你说电梯用不了？\\c\\n那当然是因为\\n我一直在保护着钥匙啦～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_member_18_02",
      "hash": "8d869275c4523f16",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 1]"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0715_rocketm_02",
      "hash": "67d15d2d939339cc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "可恶！照这样下去，\\n电梯钥匙就要被抢走了！\\c\\n……看来我只好\\n来个最后的挣扎了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0715_rocketm_03",
      "hash": "67d15e2d93933b7f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……我扔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0715_rocketm_04",
      "hash": "67d15b2d93933666",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哈……哈……\\c\\n如果没有了那把钥匙，\\n你也就没办法去到老大那里了！\\r\\n拿得到的话，你就去拿好了～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0715_rocketm_05",
      "hash": "67d15c2d93933819",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我看这下是谁也没法\\n拿到电梯钥匙了！\\c\\n你要是有本事在墙头上走\\n就另当别论了……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0715_rocketm_06",
      "hash": "67d1592d93933300",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你的宝可梦看上去\\n动作很敏捷啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0715_sys_01",
      "hash": "89fde2f8d3fefde7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]得到了\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]电梯钥匙[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    }
  ],
